      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 01 / COLLECT + VALIDATE\nBTC & ETH · USD · every 30 minutes\n\nCoinGecko → freshness check → Coinbase fallback.\nRetries: 3 attempts, 2-second spacing. Missing fields take the error path.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 1250,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "624c4891-dc94-4feb-92aa-37373185dca2",
      "name": "Guide - Ingestion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -304
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 02 / EXPLAINABLE SIGNALS\nPrice change → volume turnover → 24h range proxy\n\nNORMAL / WATCH / HIGH-RISK → merge both assets.\nThresholds are adjustable demo rules. Range is not statistical volatility; turnover is not a volume spike.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 1100,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "320327b1-7ee7-42bd-a703-bab38ee74694",
      "name": "Guide - Signals",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1264,
        -304
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 03 / SUMMARIZE + DELIVER\nOpenAI credential connected; enable_ai is OFF.\nSheets credential connected; select document/tab + enable node/flag.\nTelegram needs bot credential + chat ID + enable both nodes/flag.\n\nDefault preview makes no writes or sends. Publish only after testing.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 1320,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "9894418a-a210-4461-bd2a-a31bf27b763c",
      "name": "Guide - Configure Outputs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2400,
        -304
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PORTFOLIO REVIEW / RELIABILITY\n**37 processing nodes • all visible • no collapsed groups**\n\n1. Execute manually and inspect **Preview Log Rows** + **No Alert – Inspect Snapshot**.\n2. Configure integrations in **Monitor Settings** and the named output nodes.\n3. Google Sheets headers: record_id, run_id, observed_at, symbol, source, price_usd, change_24h_pct, volume_24h_usd, volume_basis, turnover_24h_pct, range_24h_pct, risk, reasons, coverage, summary_mode, summary.\n\nFallback is single-exchange data: estimated quote volume, unknown source timestamp and unavailable aggregate turnover. Fallback always requests WATCH review. Invalid records are excluded; summary reports incomplete BTC/ETH coverage. Errors route to the visible notification branch; unsent errors remain in execution data.\n\nAlerts repeat each 30-minute run while conditions persist. Sheets upserts one row per asset per UTC 30-minute bucket. No orders, wallets or transactions.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 2240,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c029b61f-6cee-493a-9b7f-53724d499a20",
      "name": "Guide - Reliability and Review",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        1088
      ]
    }
